참조: [Data Visualization with ggplot2::Cheat Sheet "Zooming"](https://rstudio.github.io/cheatsheets/html/data-visualization.html#zooming)


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code .code-overflow-wrap}
library(ggplot2)
t <- ggplot(mpg, aes(cty, hwy)) + geom_point()
t
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-zoom_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-1-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### 자르지 않고 확대


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
t + coord_cartesian(xlim = c(0, 100), ylim = c(10,20))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-zoom_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code .code-overflow-wrap}
t + scale_x_continuous(limits = c(0, 100)) + scale_y_continuous(limits = c(0, 100))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-zoom_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### 자르면서 확대(보이지 않는 데이터 제거)


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code .code-overflow-wrap}
t + xlim(0, 100) + ylim(10, 20)
## Warning: Removed 145 rows containing missing values or values outside the scale range
## (`geom_point()`).
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-zoom_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::
